            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>while döngüsü, koşulu <code>True</code> olduğu sürece kod bloğunu tekrarlar. <code>True</code> koşulunu, ardından iki nokta <code>:</code> gelecek şekilde <code>True</code> ile kodlarız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"11\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>True:</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
