            "id": 78304,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>False:</code>'tan sonra girintili olan koda ne ad verilir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Echo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Bir kod bloğu</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir koşul</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Bir kod bloğu.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>False</code> değerini <code>True</code> yapsaydın girintili kod bloğu ne yapardı?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Echo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Echo</code> ifadesini tekrar tekrar yazdırırdı.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Echo</code> ifadesini bir kez yazdırıp dururdu.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(\"Echo\")</code> ifadesini atlamayı sürdürürdü.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Echo</code> ifadesini tekrar tekrar yazdırırdı.</p></body></html>",
